        "notes": "## Changelog\n\n### Other\n- feat: Add missing file relink repair flow (#48) by @arnoldhao\n  - 修复失效文件重链流程\n  - Add missing file relink repair flow\n  - Resolve #45\n- feat: support extracted batch download urls (#50) by @arnoldhao\n  - 中文：支持从混合文本中提取下载链接，新增批量下载配置表格、每项应用会话/质量设置，并加入 yt-dlp 下载并发调度与设置项。\n  - English: Extract downloadable URLs from mixed text, add batch download item controls for session cookies and quality, and schedule yt-dlp jobs with configurable download concurrency.\n  - Related: #44\n- fix: fix relink folder picker (#51) by @arnoldhao\n  - 修复 Windows 下失效文件重选文件夹可能不弹出的问题。\n  - Fix missing-file relink folder picker not opening on Windows.",
